{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Abandoned House (also called the \"Ruined House\" on the in-game map) is a house located in the south of ",["l","煤矿森林","Cindersap Forest"],". A mouse takes over the building and opens a shop there selling ",["l","帽子","hats"]," to ",["l","玩家角色","the player"]," as soon as the first ",["l","成就","achievement"]," is earned."]],["p",["Hats are purely cosmetic. A new hat will appear in the shop whenever an achievement is earned. Hats won at the ",["l","复活节","Egg Festival"]," and ",["l","冰雪节","Festival of Ice"]," will also appear in the hat shop, once it is unlocked."]]]],["Letter",2,[["p",["A letter is sent in the mail the day after the first achievement is earned, which notifies the player that the hat shop is open. The hat shop can be visited without reading the letter, however."]],["q",["Hi.\nMe sell hats. Okay, poke?\nCome to old old old haus, poke. Bring coines.\n-hat mouse"],[]]]],["Shop",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Hat Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Achievement"]},{"h":1,"v":["Achievement Description"]}],[[["f","Good_Ol'_Cap.png",54]],[["l","老伙计帽","Good Ol' Cap"]],["A floppy old topper with a creased bill. Looks like it's been through a lot."],["Greenhorn"],["Earn 15,000g."]],[[["f","Lucky_Bow.png",54]],[["l","幸运蝴蝶结","Lucky Bow"]],["The middle is made of solid gold."],["Cowpoke"],["Earn 50,000g."]],[[["f","Cool_Cap.png",54]],[["l","凉帽","Cool Cap"]],["It looks really faded, but it used to be a vibrant blue."],["Homesteader"],["Earn 250,000g."]],[[["f","Bowler_Hat.png",54]],[["l","圆顶礼帽","Bowler Hat"]],["Made from smooth felt."],["Millionaire"],["Earn 1,000,000g."]],[[["f","Sombrero.png",60]],[["l","墨西哥帽","Sombrero"]],["A festively decorated hat made from woven straw."],["Legend"],["Earn 10,000,000g."]],[[["f","Blue_Bonnet.png",54]],[["l","蓝色软帽","Blue Bonnet"]],["Harken back to simpler times with this prairie bonnet."],["Treasure Trove"],["Donate 40 different items to The ",["l","博物馆","Museum"],"."]],[[["f","